<div class="page-header"><div class="inner"><div class="section-label">Legal</div><h1>SMS <em>terms &amp; conditions</em></h1><p>Last updated: November 18, 2026</p></div></div>
<section class="section"><div class="inner"><div class="legal-body">
<p>These SMS Terms &amp; Conditions apply to optional text message programs operated by Flatirons Creative Studio LLC, Boulder, Colorado.</p>
<h2>Program description</h2>
<p>With your separate consent, we may send service-related texts about inquiries, missed calls, consultations, appointments, reminders and requested services. If you separately opt in to marketing texts, we may send occasional offers and information about website design, digital marketing, AI automation and related services.</p>
<h2>How to join</h2>
<p>On our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a> or <a href="/intake/">project intake form</a>, provide your mobile number and actively check the optional SMS consent checkbox for the kind of messages you wish to receive. Service and promotional opt-ins are separate and neither is required to submit a form or purchase services. We do not treat merely calling us as consent to promotional texting.</p>
<h2>Frequency and charges</h2>
<p>Message frequency varies according to your inquiries, appointments and separately selected promotional preferences. Message and data rates may apply. Your mobile carrier may charge for texts.</p>
<h2>Opt out and help</h2>
<p>Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to any message to opt out. You may receive one final confirmation message. Reply <strong>HELP</strong> for assistance, or contact <a href="mailto:tcusworth@fcstudio.us">tcusworth@fcstudio.us</a>. To resume messages after opting out, you must opt in again.</p>
<h2>Carrier information</h2>
<p>Mobile carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages. Delivery depends on carrier coverage and network availability.</p>
<h2>Privacy</h2><p>Read our <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>, including its SMS consent and mobile-information sharing provisions.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>Flatirons Creative Studio LLC, Boulder, Colorado. <a href="mailto:tcusworth@fcstudio.us">tcusworth@fcstudio.us</a>.</p>
</div></div></section>
